      "x": 58,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 405.04,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Flight API down: retry with backoff, circuit breaker\nDatabase down: bounded buffer holds the batches\nCrash and replay: idempotent writes, no duplicates",
